    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d319">

                <pb facs="0334" n="324" sameAs="frus:frus1943v01/pg324"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">840.48 Refugees/40363/6</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by President Roosevelt to the Secretary of
                        State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-07-09">July 9, 1943</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>I thank you for your memorandum number 308 of July 5th,<anchor n="90"
                        xml:id="d319-f1"/> by which you have forwarded to me a recommended message
                    to the Prime Minister in response to his 339.</p>
                <p>I have sent the message and I request that you initiate the measures listed in
                    the fourth paragraph of your memorandum.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>F[<hi rendition="#small-caps">ranklin</hi>] D. R[<hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">oosevelt</hi>]</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
